  "status": "verified",
  "diagnosis": "The original adapter accessed the removed `payment_intent` field on the Invoice object, which raises a KeyError after upgrading to the 2025\u201103\u201131.basil version. The new version introduces an `invoice.payments` array that holds one or more payment objects. The repaired function follows the independent audit policy: it validates the presence and types of `invoice.payments` and its `data` list, skips malformed entries, only processes items whose `payment.type` is exactly \"payment_intent\", and extracts a non\u2011empty string ID either directly or from an expanded object\u2019s `id`. This yields the required `payment_intent_ids` list while preserving order and duplicates.",
